          <img src="/images/octonics-logo.png" alt="Octonics Innovations" class="h-10 w-auto" loading="lazy" />
        </a>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
          Next-gen IT & Smart Automation Company in Kuwait.  
