          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/octonics.global" aria-label="Instagram" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7.75 2A5.75 5.75 0 0 0 2 7.75v8.5A5.75 5.75 0 0 0 7.75 22h8.5A5.75 5.75 0 0 0 22 16.25v-8.5A5.75 5.75 0 0 0 16.25 2h-8.5ZM4.5 7.75A3.25 3.25 0 0 1 7.75 4.5h8.5A3.25 3.25 0 0 1 19.5 7.75v8.5a3.25 3.25 0 0 1-3.25 3.25h-8.5A3.25 3.25 0 0 1 4.5 16.25v-8.5Zm12.75-.5a1 1 0 1 0 0 2h.01a1 1 0 0 0 0-2Zm-5.25 1a4.25 4.25 0 1 0 0 8.5a4.25 4.25 0 0 0 0-8.5Zm0 2a2.25 2.25 0 1 1 0 4.5a2.25 2.25 0 0 1 0-4.5Z"/></svg></a>
